    "## 14. Validate the minimum forecasting schema\n",
    "\n",
    "A successful acquisition does not imply that the dataset is ready for modeling. This initial gate checks whether the file can support the project’s city/date/AQI structure and reports data issues without attempting to repair them.\n",
    "\n",
    "Important: AQI values above 500, negative values, parse failures, and duplicates are flagged for investigation. They are not silently removed or clipped here."
   ]
